docs/metropolia/
Metropolia2026/

# --- ADMIN & SECRETS ---
# NEVER PUSH ADMIN FOLDER - Contains deployment configs, credentials, and sensitive data
# All exceptions removed January 29, 2026 for security
Admin/

# Exception: Public policy pages on website (not actual confidential data)
!dws10.com/data-handling-policy/
!dws10.com/data-handling-policy/**
SFTP_SECRETS.py

# --- AGENT FOUNDRY (BUSINESS CRITICAL - LOCAL ONLY) ---
# All internal Agent Foundry files are confidential (model specs, architecture, vertical specs)
AgentFoundry/
# Exception: PUBLIC customer-facing documentation only
!AgentFoundry/LIFETIME_AGENT_FOUNDRY_CUSTOMER.md
# Exception: PUBLIC workflow definitions (if used by GitHub Actions/CI/CD)
!AgentFoundry/workflows/
!AgentFoundry/workflows/**
# Exception: PUBLIC training references (no proprietary info)
!AgentFoundry/README.md
# Exception: PUBLIC calculus/methodology papers
!AgentFoundry/Calculus_for_Training.md
SFTP_SECRETS.py

